<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 18.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on June 18.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 June 18		June 17</p>
<p>Fed acct			 9.050		  7.3457</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  31.407		 28.355</p>
<p>Cash balance		  40.458		 35.702</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,246.481	     5,243.455</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $4 million were issued and $30 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
